UnitDynamicSwapFeeHook::GetBeforeSwapFee
├── when block fee is zero
│   └── it computes and returns the first fee
├── when first tx initial fee is not zero
│   └── it returns first tx initial fee
├── when block fee is not ZERO_FEE_INDICATOR
│   └── it returns block fee
└── when block fee is ZERO_FEE_INDICATOR
    └── it returns 0
